 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "We hold the spirit of faith in hand",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Believing what is written and planned",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Speaking out because we believe",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The truth that the heart is meant to receive",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Our outer self is wasting away",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the inner self is renewed day by day",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.01,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Our light affliction is momentary",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.04,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Producing an eternal weight of glory",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We do not lose heart in the test",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But look on what is unseen and blessed",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
